21. Bd3 $6 ( { It was more important to activate the rook with the accurate } 21. Rad1 $1 { preparing a d4-d5 break against Black's potential ...Nh5; after } h6 ( { Or } 21. Bd3 Nd7 22. Ng4 $14 { with attacking chances on the kingside. } ) 
 ( 21. Bd3 Nh5 $6 { is met by } 22. d5 $1 { ± } ) 
22. Qe3 $14 { with a good and flexible position. } ) 
Nd7 ( { Instead } 21... Nh5 $1 { would allow Black to gain counterplay on the kingside, for example } 22. Rad1 $2 { is met by } f6 $1 { and now Black wins material after: } 23. Ng4 Nf4 24. Bf1 Nh3 $1 25. Kh1 h5 26. Ne3 Nf2 27. Kg1 Nxd1 $19 ) 
 ( { Or if } 21... Nh5 22. Bf1 f6 23. Ng4 Nf4 ) 
